<!--
  English. Keep protocol and product nouns byte-identical to the Chinese file:
  SOCKS5, HTTP, PAC, DNS, sing-box, Clash API, Wi-Fi, VPN, Hysteria2, IPv6.
  People arrive here from v2rayNG / Every Proxy and look for those exact words.

  Tone note: the Chinese copy is deliberately blunt about failure modes
  ("your console will silently stop being proxied"). Translate that bluntness
  rather than softening it into marketing voice — the whole point of those
  sentences is that the user acts on them.
-->
